Respond with this exact JSON shape:
{
  "category": "one of: job_opportunity | finance | newsletter | social | promotional | travel | legal | health | security | personal | work | other",
  "urgency_score": 1-10,
  "tier": "URGENT | MODERATE | LOW",
  "summary": "2-3 sentence summary",
  "action": "what the user should do, or empty string",
  "skip": false
}

Set skip=true if the email category is NOT in user's active categories, or urgency_score is below the threshold. Tier: URGENT=7-10, MODERATE=3-6, LOW=1-2.

